msgid "Open the page"
msgstr "Open the page"

msgctxt "Languages::euph_pages_in_blocks.info_intro"
msgid "Show the content of your pages, forms and polls anywhere on the storefront with a Page content block:"
msgstr "Show the content of your pages, forms and polls anywhere on the storefront with a Page content block:"

msgctxt "Languages::euph_pages_in_blocks.info_step_layouts"
msgid "Open Design → Layouts, then the layout and the location (tab) where the content should appear, for example the product page or the homepage."
msgstr "Open Design → Layouts, then the layout and the location (tab) where the content should appear, for example the product page or the homepage."

msgctxt "Languages::euph_pages_in_blocks.info_step_add"
msgid "In a grid, click Add block → Create new block → Page content, and give the block a name."
msgstr "In a grid, click Add block → Create new block → Page content, and give the block a name."

msgctxt "Languages::euph_pages_in_blocks.info_step_content"
msgid "On the block's Content tab, pick the pages: they show in the order you pick them."
msgstr "On the block's Content tab, pick the pages: they show in the order you pick them."

msgctxt "Languages::euph_pages_in_blocks.info_step_template"
msgid "On the Settings tab, choose the template (One under another, Tabs, Accordion or Cards) and its options."
msgstr "On the Settings tab, choose the template (One under another, Tabs, Accordion or Cards) and its options."

msgctxt "Languages::euph_pages_in_blocks.info_hidden_pages"
msgid "Only the pages the visitor may see are shown: a disabled page, a page outside its availability period or one reserved for other user groups is left out. Tip: set a page to Hidden to use it only as block content: it stays out of the menus and the page lists, and the block still shows it."
msgstr "Only the pages the visitor may see are shown: a disabled page, a page outside its availability period or one reserved for other user groups is left out. Tip: set a page to Hidden to use it only as block content: it stays out of the menus and the page lists, and the block still shows it."

msgctxt "Languages::euph_pages_in_blocks.info_forms"
msgid "Forms (Form builder add-on) and polls (Polls add-on) work in the block as on their own page. The block is never cached, so a form's confirmation or a poll's result is seen only by the visitor who sent it."
msgstr "Forms (Form builder add-on) and polls (Polls add-on) work in the block as on their own page. The block is never cached, so a form's confirmation or a poll's result is seen only by the visitor who sent it."

msgctxt "Languages::euph_pages_in_blocks.info_open_layouts"
msgid "Open Design → Layouts"
msgstr "Open Design → Layouts"
